From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] shell: route every Home path through go_home

Make Home navigation a single semantic action. Physical F3 delivery, the
GTK4 navigation menu, the shell D-Bus API, and future automation all converge
on the same `jarabe.view.actions.go_home()` implementation.
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/jarabe/view/actions.py
@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+"""Canonical semantic actions exposed by the GTK4 Sugar shell."""
+
+from jarabe import frame
+from jarabe.model import shell
+
+
+def go_home():
+    """Return to Home and clear the active Activity surface."""
+    frame.get_view().hide()
+    model = shell.get_model()
+    model._set_active_activity(None)
+    model.set_zoom_level(model.ZOOM_HOME)
+    return True
